Package: com.zeshan.phoneaura
Name: PhoneAura
Version: 0.4.13
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: PhoneAura is a free, modern redesign of the iOS 16 Phone app. Version 0.4.13 restores the original Number Options menu inside the orange number card and replaces only the upper-right three-dot button beside Keypad with the round Next Solution logo. Tapping the upper logo opens the official Next Solution YouTube channel. It preserves the fixed saved-number suggestion area, Number not saved status, custom Favorites, smart Recents filters, call details, Contacts, swipe-to-delete controls, haptics and fluid animations. Available for RootHide and rootless jailbreaks.
Depiction: https://zeshan0727.github.io/depictions/phoneaura.html
Homepage: https://zeshan0727.github.io/
Maintainer: Next Solution
Author: Next Solution
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0), mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
